{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChLGGeFQXrZD3FKkQSKxV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HpyPQxrW4neK9E8HUTjNjj","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/work/.ard/223/triage-lead.md","content":"---\nrole: lead\nstatus: done\nattempt: 1\nnext: [triage:engineer]\nworker: engineer\n---\nA bug fix in the triage fan-in gate: it should refuse to announce readiness for approval when the issue has no plan file and flag the issue for a human instead. The change stays within the triage package, its tests and the proposal's triage section, so the engineer plan is enough.\n\n## Routing\n- triage:engineer: implementation steps for the missing-plan check in the fan-in gate, the fake-based test for the no-plan case, a regression check for the existing path, and the proposal update.\n- worker engineer: code change in the triage gate with unit tests and the doc edit.\n\n## Open issues\n- The fix changes behaviour that a maintainer triggers by removing labels by hand; the runbook for Gate 2 also describes the ready-for-approval step and may need a matching note.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":690,"cache_read_input_tokens":10573,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":690},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e1650057-050d-4a76-9dfa-0e22ca506fe1","uuid":"31283f66-8857-4f05-9b38-8e1e65cf10df","timestamp":"2026-11-23T17:35:57.132Z","request_id":"req_011ChLGGe5zNWAsjZTN5p1Kr"}
